   AUTHOR: PlantSafety Platform
   CREATED: 2026-07-14
   FILE DESCRIPTION: Predictions List page (Volume P1 §3). Active/historical/
     superseded predictions. Built from the canonical Shared component
     library (DataGridComponent, SeverityBadgeComponent, PaginationComponent,
     ErrorBoundaryComponent, LoadingIndicatorComponent).
